+## 2026-10-24 bounded peer review
+
+The task-local regression file could not run in the portable staged checker because it derived the canonical ledger from `parents[1]/data/canonical`, a path that exists only in a different checkout layout. It now uses the supported `reviewer_support.find_root` and `canonical_pairs` helpers. The repaired staged suite passes 7 tests.
